      "writtenOn": "2025-02-13T12:27:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks! We\u0027re getting some random hangs on waits when `vkGetFenceFdKHR` is used from the guest side on Windows. It\u0027s hard to say if this fixes all the issues at this point due to the randomness of the problem, but adding these entry points and using the same structure will also help re-landing changes necessary to remove waitforfences call at the end of queue submissions for vulkan to gles flush operations.",
      "parentUuid": "01174c3a_9468a6e2",
      "revId": "0a8d9d74fd9ec36ba1ee1f64d3096f489f4f7edb",
